        "en": "Developer terms"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-Hans": "编程、云服务和开发工具里常被听错的英文名词。",
        "en": "English names from programming, cloud and dev tools that speech recognition often gets wrong."
      },
      "author": "TypeLeast",
      "license": "CC0-1.0",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/FlaxXTT/Typeleast/tree/main/market",
      "terms": [
